[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0246","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0246.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3913","title":"Google Chrome 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 16.0.912.63 之前版本中存在一处释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，位于 Range 处理逻辑中。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页，触发已释放内存对象的非法访问，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，或可能进一步实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 WebKit 内核的 Chrome 浏览器版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Google 已在 16.0.912.63 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3913"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-12-13T21:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:08Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 16.0.912.63 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Range 处理中的释放后重用漏洞。如无法升级，可禁用 JavaScript 或使用 Chrome 的 --no-sandbox 相关安全策略作为临时缓解，但建议优先完成版本升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=103921","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/12/stable-channel-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14527","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3913.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3913","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3913.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3913","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3913","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02