79","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3909.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3909","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3909.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3909","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3909","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3909.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2011/CVE-2011-3909.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3909.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3909.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3909"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0244","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3908","title":"Google Chrome SVG解析越界读取漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 16.0.912.63之前版本中存在越界读取漏洞，该漏洞源于程序未能正确解析SVG文档。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的SVG文件，诱使其在受影响浏览器中打开，触发越界内存读取，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响Chrome 16.0.912.63之前所有版本，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中危。Google已在Chrome 16.0.912.63版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3908"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-12-13T21:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:08Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 16.0.912.63 及以上版本（2011年12月稳定版更新已修复）。Apple 用户需将 Safari 升级至 5.1.4 以上、iTunes 升级至 10.6 以上、iOS 升级至 5.1 以上。如无法升级，可禁用 JavaScript 对 SVG 的解析或通过内容安全策略（CSP）限制 SVG 加载作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=100863","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/12/stable-channel-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73807","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14791","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3908.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3908","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3908.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3908","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3908","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3908.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2011/CVE-2011-3908.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3908.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3908.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3908"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0243","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3903","title":"Google Chrome 正则表达式越界读取漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 16.0.912.63之前版本中存在正则表达式匹配越界读取漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的网页内容，诱使目标用户访问，触发浏览器在正则表达式匹配过程中发生越界内存读取，导致信息泄露或拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响所有未更新的Chrome浏览器用户。Google已在16.0.912.63版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3903"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-12-13T21:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:07Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 16.0.912.63 或更高版本。Ubuntu 用户可通过更新 chromium-browser 包至 17.0.963.56~r121963 系列版本修复。企业环境应通过组策略强制推送 Chrome 自动更新，或使用集中管理工具统一升级。如无法立即升级，可限制用户访问不可信网站作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=81753","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/12/stable-channel-update.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14704","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3903.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3903.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3903","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3903","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3903.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3903.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3903","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2011/CVE-2011-3903.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-39xx/CVE-2011-3903.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3903.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0243.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0088","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2462","title":"Adobe Acrobat/Reader U3D内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Reader 和 Acrobat 的 U3D 组件存在内存破坏漏洞，攻击者可构造特制的 PDF 文件，诱导用户打开后触发 U3D 解析过程中的内存越界写入，导致远程代码执行或程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 Mac OS X 平台上的 Adobe Reader/Acrobat 10.1.1 及更早版本，以及 UNIX 平台上的 Adobe Reader 9.x 至 9.4.6 版本。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。该漏洞已在 2011 年 12 月被野外利用，Metasploit 框架已集成对应利用模块，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过诱导用户打开恶意 PDF 文件实现完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2462"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-12-07T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:23Z","remediation":"立即将 Adobe Reader 和 Acrobat 升级至 10.1.2 及以上版本（Windows/Mac），UNIX 系统升级至 Reader 9.4.7 及以上版本。作为临时缓解措施，可通过注册表或组策略禁用 U3D 插件：在 Windows 中设置 Adobe Reader 的增强安全选项，或使用 Adobe Customization Wizard 统一部署禁用 U3D。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2012-0011 提供的更新包。同时建议在邮件网关层面拦截含 3D 内容的 PDF 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-01/msg00019.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-01/msg00020.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/advisories/apsa11-04.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-30.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-01.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2012-0011.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA11-350A.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14562","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/199","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-2462","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18366","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-2462.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2462.json","https://github.com/stamparm/maltrail/blob/cc8d45f6e59acbd859e1a1046f87573663eeff61/trails/static/malware/sykipot.txt","https://github.com/jesparza/peepdf/blob/c74dc65c0ac7e506bae4f2582a2435ec50741f40/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2462","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2011/CVE-2011-2462/README_KO.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2011-2462.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/SSVC/data/2011/CVE-2011-2462.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2011-2462.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0226","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0226.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3639","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_proxy 反向代理安全绕过漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 的 mod_proxy 模块在配置为反向代理时，对 RewriteRule 和 ProxyPassMatch 指令的模式匹配处理存在输入验证缺陷（CWE-20）。远程攻击者可通过构造包含 @ 符号的畸形 URI，利用 HTTP/0.9 协议发送特制请求，绕过代理限制将请求转发至内部网络服务器，导致内网信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.0.x 至 2.0.64 及 2.2.x 至 2.2.18 版本，是 CVE-2011-3368 修复不完整所致，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3639"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-30T04:05:58Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:40Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.2.18 或更高版本（2.0.x 用户升级至 2.0.65 以上）。如无法立即升级，在反向代理配置中避免将 RewriteRule 或 ProxyPassMatch 与 HTTP/0.9 协议结合使用，并在 ProxyRequests 指令中限制允许转发的目标地址范围，仅允许代理到可信内部网段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0128.html","http://svn.apache.org/viewvc?view=revision&revision=1188745","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2405","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=752080","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36663","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2011/CVE-2011-3639.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3639.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2011/CVE-2011-3639.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-3639.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3639","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3639","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2011/CVE-2011-3639.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-3639.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3639","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3639"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0226.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2011/EXP-AVE-2011-0226.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0226.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0112","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2453","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 及 Adobe AIR 存在内存破坏漏洞（CWE-119），属于缓冲区边界操作限制不当问题。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的 Flash 内容触发未指定的内存破坏，导致远程代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 及 Android 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.11 之前版本和 11.1.102.55 之前版本，以及 Adobe AIR 3.1.0.4880 之前版本。攻击无需身份认证，仅需用户浏览恶意网页即可触发，CVSS v2 评分 10.0，危害严重。Adobe 已在安全公告 APSB11-28 中发布修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2453"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2011-11-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 Adobe Flash Player 升级至 10.3.183.11（10.x 分支）或 11.1.102.55（11.x 桌面版）/ 11.1.102.59（Android 版），将 Adobe AIR 升级至 3.1.0.4880 及以上版本。由于 Adobe 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日停止 Flash Player 支持并建议卸载，最彻底的修复方案是从系统中完全卸载 Flash Player 及 Adobe AIR，改用 HTML5 替代方案。如因遗留业务必须使用，应限制 Flash 内容仅在受控内网运行，并在浏览器中启用 Click-to-Play 插件策略，防止任意网站自动加载 Flash 内容触发漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2452.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2453.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2453","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2453","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2453.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2453","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2453","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6803c56f209ac0b3251a2751d06e0a641b57c323/2011/CVE-2011-2453.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2453.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2453"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0112.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0221","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0221.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3442","title":"Apple iOS 内核 mmap 系统调用本地代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5.0.1 之前版本的内核在处理 mmap 系统调用时，未能正确验证标志位组合的有效性，存在资源管理错误漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向受影响的 iOS 设备安装特制应用程序触发该漏洞，绕过代码签名检查机制，以系统权限执行任意未签名代码。该漏洞影响 iOS 3.0 至 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Apple 已在 iOS 5.0.1 安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3442"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-11T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:17Z","remediation":"升级 Apple iOS 至 5.0.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 kernel 中 mmap 系统调用标志组合校验不严导致任意代码执行的问题。无法立即升级的设备应限制不可信应用的安装，仅从官方 App Store 下载应用，并启用 iOS 的代码签名强制检查机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011/Nov/msg00001.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5052","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026287","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3442.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3442","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3442.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3442.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2011/CVE-2011-3442.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3442.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3442.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-34xx/CVE-2011-3442.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3442.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2011-3442.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0221.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0220","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0220.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3441","title":"Apple iOS libinfo 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5.0.1 之前版本的 libinfo 组件在处理 DNS 主机名查询时未能正确构造域名查询请求，远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 DNS 主机名触发该漏洞，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Apple iOS 3.0 至 5.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。Apple 已在 iOS 5.0.1 更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3441"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-11T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:17Z","remediation":"升级 Apple iOS 至 5.0.1 或更高版本（参考苹果安全公告 http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5052），该更新修复了 libinfo 组件中 DNS 域名查询处理不当导致的信息泄露漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在受影响的 iOS 设备上限制不可信网络接入，避免连接恶意 DNS 服务器，并禁用自动 DNS 查询功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011/Nov/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Feb/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5052","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5130","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3441.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3441","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3441.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3441.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3441.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3441.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3441.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2011-3441.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-34xx/CVE-2011-3441.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2011/CVE-2011-3441.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0220.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0219","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0219.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3440","title":"Apple iOS 密码锁绕过漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5.0.1 之前版本（iPad 2）的 Passcode Lock 密码锁功能未正确实现锁定状态。当攻击者在电源关闭确认过程中打开 iPad 2 的 Smart Cover（智能保护盖）时，可绕过密码锁定的限制，从而获取设备上未加密的数据，构成未经授权的数据访问。该漏洞利用条件要求物理接触设备，且需在设备处于电源关闭确认过程中打开智能保护盖，属于本地物理访问场景，危害相对较低，CVSS 评分 1.2。攻击者无需任何认证即可通过该方式窃取设备中的数据。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3440"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-11T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:17Z","remediation":"立即通过 iTunes 或设备“设置→通用→软件更新”将 Apple iPad 2 等受影响设备升级至 iOS 5.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Passcode Lock 的锁定状态实现缺陷，防止在关机确认阶段通过 Smart Cover 绕过密码读取数据。在无法立即升级时，作为临时缓解措施，请勿在公共场所使用 Smart Cover 搭配自动锁定开启状态，并设置较短的自动锁定等待时间增强密码锁定强度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011/Nov/msg00001.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5052","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3440.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3440","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3440.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3440.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3440.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3440.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3440.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963f7056505b7264e8baa3ce879232850f792056/2011/CVE-2011-3440.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2011-3440.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-34xx/CVE-2011-3440.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0219.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0218","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0218.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3439","title":"Apple iOS CoreGraphics FreeType 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5.0.1 之前版本中 CoreGraphics 组件所集成的 FreeType 字体渲染引擎存在越界写入漏洞（CWE-787）。远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送包含特制字体的文档（如 PDF 或网页），在字体解析过程中触发内存破坏，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证但需要用户交互（打开恶意文档），影响 iOS 3.0 至 5.0 版本。Apple 已在 iOS 5.0.1 更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3439"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-11T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:17Z","remediation":"升级 Apple iOS 至 5.0.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 CoreGraphics 中 FreeType 字体处理的内存破坏漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议避免在 iOS 设备上打开来源不明的文档文件，并禁用 Safari 自动字体渲染功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011/Nov/msg00001.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-12/msg00008.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-01/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-01/msg00012.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/46921","http://secunia.com/advisories/48951","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5052","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3439","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3439.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3439","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3439","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3439","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3439.json","https://github.com/catboost/catboost/blob/7889a175e56939839d2dde9509bcf74d6285044e/contrib/libs/freetype/docs/CHANGES","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963f7056505b7264e8baa3ce879232850f792056/2011/CVE-2011-3439.json","https://github.com/mapsme/omim/blob/1892903b63f2c85b16ed4966d21fe76aba06b9ba/3party/freetype/docs/CHANGES","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3439.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0218.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0119","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2460","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在未指定的内存破坏漏洞（CWE-119），远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的 SWF 文件触发内存越界读写，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 及 Android 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.11 之前版本和 11.1.102.55 之前版本，以及 Adobe AIR 3.1.0.4880 之前版本。攻击无需身份认证，用户仅需浏览恶意网页即可触发，CVSS v2 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Adobe 已在安全公告 APSB11-28 中发布修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2460"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-11T16:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.11（非 Android）或 11.1.102.55（非 Android）/ 11.1.102.59（Android），Adobe AIR 升级至 3.1.0.4880 及以上版本。鉴于 Adobe 已于 2020 年底停止支持 Flash，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准，同时在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00014.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00017.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00019.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48819","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-07.xml","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-28.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1445.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14260","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15836","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2452.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2460.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2460","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2460","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2460.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2460","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2460","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2011/CVE-2011-2460.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2460.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2460"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0118","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2459","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 及 Adobe AIR 存在内存破坏漏洞（CWE-119）。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的网页或打开恶意构造的 Flash 内容，触发未指定的内存破坏错误，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 及 Android 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.11 之前版本、11.x 系列 11.1.102.55 之前版本以及 Adobe AIR 3.1.0.4880 之前版本。攻击无需身份认证，远程低复杂度即可利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 Flash Player 10.3.183.11/11.1.102.55 及以上版本或 Adobe AIR 3.1.0.4880 及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2459"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-11T16:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:22Z","remediation":"升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.11（非 Android）或 11.1.102.55（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）及以上版本，Android 版升级至 11.1.102.59 及以上，Adobe AIR 升级至 3.1.0.4880 及以上。由于 Adobe 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日停止支持 Flash Player，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准，同时在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","colle